--- !u!114 &1312217327
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1312217325}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 909abf83c6323af459785be6bf3be77c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  LevelNum: 1
  Description: Ernesto Matias lost his wife and he suspects someone killed her. He
    found her body in his house.
  CaseList:
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2432ba9b3150b094490623fb93080c64, type: 3}
    Name: Matias Estate
    Description: The house is empty except a body on the floor. It bleeds from a
      small hole.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 0
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70d0a83a42f73574e84e8210d672671f, type: 3}
    Name: Ernesto Matias
    Description: I found my wife dead in our appartment. I'm sure it's not suicide!
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 259e58a1920861c4cbdbf5198b1e41f8, type: 3}
    Name: Knife
    Description: The knife has blood on. On it's handle are written the initials
      MM.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 1
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1a4458022f12e5845afe30fddd8adabf, type: 3}
    Name: Vial Of Arsenic
    Description: This vial is clearly full and hasn't been openned in ages.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 1
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d182f27cb493ae3458f73910586a02b5, type: 3}
    Name: Marti's Workshop
    Description: The workshop seems empty, except it's owner Marti Miller
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 0
  - CardFace: {fileID: -181828907702267046, guid: dee0a33d440aef94d81fb74ebdcec92c, type: 3}
    Name: Enzo Mariati
    Description: What do you want from me? I just-a-visited Liandrea, how could it
      be me?
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3cb75d5cc920b24987c45054b5a0efe, type: 3}
    Name: Marti Miller
    Description: Yes, I made that knife. A man from Itally bought it, he said he
      liked the handle.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: -6188768998144020764, guid: 0f29ae51b83c68c48880d4a1c0213539, type: 3}
    Name: Nico Matias
    Description: Yes, I killed Vanessa, indeed. But you have to understand. She was
      poisoning Ernesto's mind!
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: -7411974349392773033, guid: 6400ddb8274e67e42998800a86455f2e, type: 3}
    Name: Enzo's AirBNB
    Description: There's nothing here except a horific smell of wine.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 0
