--- !u!114 &1424908397
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1424908396}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 909abf83c6323af459785be6bf3be77c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  LevelNum: 2
  Description: Joanna's items have been stolen and she can't find them. She has important
    stuff and she needs them.
  CaseList:
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a76d2ebe528aa6f45b30cb2bd1a9e4e2, type: 3}
    Name: Johan Davidson
    Description: Yes, I did it. I'm sorry. I was hired by Dorondo to steal Joanna's
      brown notebook with GNB's finances.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: -4072966450665865877, guid: fcaa7e915973502439abbff4c4b2c980, type: 3}
    Name: A Red Notebook
    Description: This is a diary where a midleaged woman explains in detail her passion
      about Dean Winchester.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 2
  - CardFace: {fileID: 1159682439, guid: fcaa7e915973502439abbff4c4b2c980, type: 3}
    Name: A Brown Notebook
    Description: Here are written detailed financial information about GNB.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 2
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 22ccb4c47edaaab45a816a815de5b7b5, type: 3}
    Name: A Pile Of Money
    Description: These were found in Johan's house. Don't think they're part of our
      case tho.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 2
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2432ba9b3150b094490623fb93080c64, type: 3}
    Name: GNB Inc.
    Description: Sorry, can't help you. Our information leaked to Dorondo Inc.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 0
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e59bca9fe9d901c4cb8eafe1e713d1bb, type: 3}
    Name: Joanna Fredricsen
    Description: Oh, please, please, please. You have to find my notebook. If GNB
      hears about this they'll fire me.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2432ba9b3150b094490623fb93080c64, type: 3}
    Name: Dorondo Inc.
    Description: Are you accusing of us? We didn't do anything! Ask that disgrace
      of a man called Fredricsen.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 0
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3cb75d5cc920b24987c45054b5a0efe, type: 3}
    Name: Leo Fredricsen
    Description: They called me a disgrace? When I was keeping all their dirty little
      secrets? Even about Joh... Oh no!
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
